@model PEMS.Application.DTOs.ClassIntelligenceProfileDto
@using Microsoft.Extensions.Localization
@using PEMS.Web.Resources
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResource> Localizer
@{
    string StatusBadge(string status) => status switch
    {
        "READY" => "success",
        "PARTIALLY_READY" => "warning",
        "INSUFFICIENT_DATA" => "warning",
        "NOT_APPLICABLE" => "light",
        _ => "light"
    };
}

<div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
    <h5 class="mb-0"><pems-icon name="bi-diagram-3" /> Class Intelligence — @Model.Name <code class="small">@Model.Code</code></h5>
    <pems-button tone="neutral" size="small" outline="true" as="a" asp-controller="CmmsReadiness" asp-action="ClassDetail" asp-route-id="@Model.EquipmentClassId">CMMS Readiness</pems-button>
</div>
<p class="text-muted small">
    طبق «PEMS Phase 9» بند ۲۱: ترکیب IEquipmentClassCoverageService + IReliabilityAnalyticsService +
    IRcmFmeaReadinessService - هیچ محاسبه‌ی موازی جدیدی.
</p>

<pems-row gap="3" css="mb-3">
    <pems-col md="3">
        <pems-content-card css="h-100 text-center">
            <div class="fs-4 fw-bold">@Model.EquipmentCount</div>
            <div class="text-muted small">Equipment in Class</div>
        </pems-content-card>
    </pems-col>
    <pems-col md="3">
        <pems-content-card css="h-100 text-center">
            <div class="fs-4 fw-bold">@(Model.AverageMTBFHours.HasValue ? $"{Model.AverageMTBFHours.Value:N1}h" : "N/A")</div>
            <div class="text-muted small">Average MTBF (n=@Model.MTBFSampleSize)</div>
        </pems-content-card>
    </pems-col>
    <pems-col md="3">
        <pems-content-card css="h-100 text-center">
            <div class="fs-4 fw-bold">@(Model.AverageAvailabilityPercent.HasValue ? $"{Model.AverageAvailabilityPercent.Value:N1}%" : "N/A")</div>
            <div class="text-muted small">Average Availability</div>
        </pems-content-card>
    </pems-col>
    <pems-col md="3">
        <pems-content-card css="h-100 text-center">
            <div class="fs-4 fw-bold">@Model.FailureCount</div>
            <div class="text-muted small">@Localizer["Total Failures"]</div>
        </pems-content-card>
    </pems-col>
</pems-row>

<pems-row gap="3" css="mb-3">
    <pems-col md="6">
        <pems-content-card css="h-100">
            <h6 class="mb-2">FMEA / RCM Coverage</h6>
            <div>FMEA: <pems-badge tone="@StatusBadge(Model.FMEAReadiness)">@Model.FMEAReadiness</pems-badge> (@Model.ApprovedFMEACount approved)</div>
            <div>RCM: <pems-badge tone="@StatusBadge(Model.RCMReadiness)">@Model.RCMReadiness</pems-badge> (@Model.ApprovedRCMCount approved)</div>
            <hr />
            <div class="small">Definitional Coverage (direct+inherited counts):</div>
            <div class="small">Activities: @Model.TotalActivityCoverage | PM Templates: @Model.TotalPMTemplateCoverage | Failure Modes: @Model.TotalFailureModeCoverage</div>
            @if (Model.CoverageGapReasons.Any())
            {
                <div class="small text-muted mt-1">
                    @foreach (var g in Model.CoverageGapReasons) { <div>• @g</div> }
                </div>
            }
        </pems-content-card>
    </pems-col>
    <pems-col md="6">
        <pems-content-card css="h-100">
            <h6 class="mb-2">Criticality Distribution &amp; Intelligence</h6>
            @if (Model.CriticalityDistribution.Any())
            {
                @foreach (var kv in Model.CriticalityDistribution)
                {
                    <div class="small">@kv.Key: @kv.Value</div>
                }
            }
            else
            {
                <div class="small text-muted">No criticality data.</div>
            }
            <hr />
            <div class="small">Repeat Failure Groups: @Model.RepeatFailureGroupCount</div>
            <div class="small">Bad Actors in Class: @Model.BadActorCount</div>
        </pems-content-card>
    </pems-col>
</pems-row>
